<title>JAPAN: Rheon Automatic -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Rheon Automatic -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.92		vs	    6.91</p>
<p> Operating	  328    million	  vs	  373    million</p>
<p> Current	    370    million	  vs	  355    million</p>
<p> Net		  222    million	  vs	  174    million</p>
<p> EPS		    7.84 yen	  vs	    6.14 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     28 million	  vs	  28 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.50 yen	  vs	    3.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Rheon Automatic Machinery Co Ltd is a food-processing machine maker.</p>
</text>
